{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:LiftingAndDescent.RecursiveBraneTower","@type":"LeanModule","name":"LiftingAndDescent.RecursiveBraneTower","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Module.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Span.Basic"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.RecursiveBraneTower.retraction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.RecursiveBraneTower.retraction","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/recursive-brane-tower.lean#L40-L40","doc":"The descent is a left inverse of the ascent: 𝔡 ∘ ℓ = id. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.RecursiveBraneTower.descent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.RecursiveBraneTower.descent","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/recursive-brane-tower.lean#L38-L38","doc":"Descent: retraction 𝔡_{n+1} : level (n+1) → level n.\nAn R-linear map (projection from jet bundle to base). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.RecursiveBraneTower.ascent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.RecursiveBraneTower.ascent","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/recursive-brane-tower.lean#L35-L35","doc":"Ascent: jet prolongation ℓₙ : level n → level (n+1).\nAn R-linear embedding (the unit section of the jet bundle). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.RecursiveBraneTower.instModule","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.RecursiveBraneTower.instModule","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/recursive-brane-tower.lean#L32-L32","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.RecursiveBraneTower.instAddCommGroup","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.RecursiveBraneTower.instAddCommGroup","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/recursive-brane-tower.lean#L31-L31","doc":"Each level carries an R-module structure. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.RecursiveBraneTower.level","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.RecursiveBraneTower.level","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/recursive-brane-tower.lean#L29-L29","doc":"The module at level n (representing End_𝒞(Aₙ)). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.RecursiveBraneTower.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.RecursiveBraneTower.mk","kind":"ctor","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/recursive-brane-tower.lean#L27-L27","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.RecursiveBraneTower","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.RecursiveBraneTower","kind":"structure","line":18,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/recursive-brane-tower.lean#L18-L40","doc":"The recursive brane tower: a sequence of R-modules connected by\nascent embeddings (jet prolongation) and descent retractions.\n\nStarting from A₀ = A, the tower is defined by A_{n+1} = J¹(Aₙ).\nThe ascent maps are the canonical inclusions Aₙ ↪ J¹(Aₙ) via the\nunit section, and the descent maps are the retractions.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:recursive-brane-tower}` ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:recursive-brane-tower","label":"def:recursive-brane-tower","md":"quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/recursive-brane-tower.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}